From 9547b1f709bbece05ba1bfa39bb19ba558fcba2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:22:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] docs/Project.toml: SpeedyWeather compat up to 0.26, as in
 Project.toml and test/

Terrarium's main (0.2.0-DEV, taken from git by the workspace) now requires SpeedyWeatherInternals 1.0.1, which
SpeedyWeather 0.23-0.24 do not allow. The workspace (docs, examples, test) is resolved as a whole, so docs' older
SpeedyWeather compat made instantiating the test environment unsatisfiable. Project.toml allows 0.22-0.26 and
test/ 0.23-0.26; docs/ now matches test/.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvpxdTuD5JaD3hFhzdz
---
 docs/Project.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/docs/Project.toml b/docs/Project.toml
index af4a0abc..50966122 100755
--- a/docs/Project.toml
+++ b/docs/Project.toml
@@ -50,5 +50,5 @@ Enzyme = "0.13.166"
 Literate = "2.2"
 Oceananigans = "0.117.2, 0.118"
 Reactant = "0.2.278"
-SpeedyWeather = "0.23, 0.24"
+SpeedyWeather = "0.23, 0.24, 0.25, 0.26"
 Terrarium = "0.1.10, 0.2"
-- 
2.43.0

